  <!--EN: A particularly strange combination. Already acidic coffee garnished with a wedge of more acidic lemon, meant to be juiced into the coffee before quickly consumed while hot. An acquired taste to be sure but lauded by those who do prefer it. Specially indicated to combat intestinal parasites.-->
  <VBE_LemonCoffee.description>一个特别奇怪的组合。已经是酸性的咖啡，上面装饰着一块更酸的柠檬，意味着要在热时快速饮用之前将其榨汁到咖啡中。当然，这是一种后天习得的品味，但也受到那些喜欢它的人的称赞。特别适用于对抗肠道寄生虫。</VBE_LemonCoffee.description>
