  <!--EN: A tall tree native to both deserts and tropics alike. Bright, sour lemons grow profusely on this tree, some lemons may even mature early and fall to the ground before the primary harvest is ready.-->
  <VBE_LemonTree.description>一种高大的树，原产于沙漠和热带地区。明亮、酸酸的柠檬在这棵树上大量生长，有些柠檬甚至可能在初次收获准备好之前就提前成熟落到地上。</VBE_LemonTree.description>
