  <!--EN: An acid and sour tasting fruit. The juice, zest, and pulp are often used in cooking, often on fish and other meat for better taste. Lemon is also used to flavour drinks, such as lemonade, or mixed with tea and coffee.-->
  <VCE_RawLemon.description>一种酸酸的水果。果汁、果皮和果肉经常用于烹饪，通常用在鱼和其他肉类上以获得更好的味道。柠檬还用于给饮料调味，例如柠檬水，或与茶和咖啡混合。</VCE_RawLemon.description>
